  "title": "Forrester’s 2025 Australian Digital Experience Review: Delivering Personalized Experiences And Prioritizing The Customers’ Financial Wellbeing Are Next Frontiers In Mobile Banking",
  "summary": "Westpac Dominates Australian Mobile Banking For The Third Consecutive With Tailored Digital Experiences SYDNEY, 30 September 2025 — A new Forrester (Nasdaq: FORR) report reveals that while Australian banks have improved their mobile app experiences, most still don’t provide personalized digital experiences or tools that help customers manager their long-term financial health. According to Forrester’s 2025 Financial Services Banking Survey, 69% of Australian online adults used a mobile banking app in the past month, making […]",
